<title>USA: Valley National Bancorp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Valley National Bancorp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								March 31,</p>
<p> (Dollars in thousands except per share data)  1997	1996</p>
<p> NET INCOME:				$    20,900   $    19,419</p>
